Package: libmutter-14-dev
Version: @DEB_MUTTER_V@
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: @DEB_MAINTAINER@
Depends: libmutter-14-0 (= @DEB_MUTTER_V@), libgtk-4-dev, libglib2.0-dev, libgraphene-1.0-dev, libjson-glib-dev, liblcms2-dev, libcolord-dev, libxcomposite-dev, libxfixes-dev, libpixman-1-dev, libxkbcommon-dev
Section: Development
Priority: optional
Description: window manager library from the Mutter window manager (development files)
 Mutter is a window and compositing manager based on Clutter and bundling its
 own copies of Cogl and Clutter. It is the GNOME Shell compositor.
 .
 This package contains the headers and pkg-config files (libmutter-14,
 mutter-clutter-14, mutter-cogl-14, mutter-cogl-pango-14, mutter-mtk-14) needed
 to build against Mutter and, on iOS, to run g-ir-scanner natively to generate
 the Meta / Clutter / Cogl / CoglPango / Mtk introspection typelibs. The
 dependency list mirrors the namespaces those scans --include.
